{"version":1,"content":"<p>梅艷芳國際歌迷會昨晚發出緊急呼籲，稱自今年7月起安放大嶼山寶蓮禪寺海會塔的梅艷芳骨灰被盜去，報警至今近3個月仍未尋回。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T06:38:08.481531+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":59,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T06:13:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:27:38.624457+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"ad1b3771002200202323efb170ae3eeee6b8428623f6f96b5b3d93de2914a47a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}